OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers stabbed youth to death
OL,4,Aoutside library
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been convicted over
OL,7,Fthe killing of a teenager, found
OL,8,Fstabbed near a library.
OL,10,FMichael Ababio was attacked on Broad
OL,11,FStreet, near Foleshill Library in
OL,12,FCoventry, on the evening of 22 February
OL,13,Fand died the following morning.
OL,15,FIsmail Nabeel from Coventry, who is
OL,16,Falso 18, had admitted a manslaughter
OL,17,Fcharge, but has been found guilty of
OL,18,Fhis murder after a trial at Warwick
OL,19,FCrown Court.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
