OL,4,Aoutside library
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old, who cannot be named,
OL,7,Fpreviously admitted a charge of murder,
OL,8,Fwith two others Mahat Mohammed, 19, and
OL,9,FShakeel Ahmed, 18, previously admitting
OL,10,Fto manslaughter.
